MFDC install package

You may download this package and install it. Without a licence file the
product runs as a demo: up to 10 SIP devices and 5 contact-center operators
per domain.

A commercial licence removes these limits. To buy one, contact the author
on Telegram: https://t.me/voip_dmitiy

You may not present this package as your own product or strip this notice.
